# Playwright MCP writes to the repo root even when an agent is working in a
# worktree, so verification screenshots and a11y snapshots land here as
# untracked scratch. Two of them were committed by accident on 2026-08-19 and
# sat in the root until 2026-08-24. Root-level images are never sources in
# this project — real assets live in `public/` or `src/`.
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.webp
